      "rationale": "Retrieved hierarchy card and inspected cached primary benchmark section2.3/pinned forward/tokenizer. Its field/task token interactions are a nearest stacked-architecture neighbor, not evidence for conditional feedback background pooling. No HiFormer component is adopted. Original full paper not audited. Latest declared consideration of HiFormer/EST/RankMixer produced no incumbent improvement in round14, so it is not upgraded to mechanism support.",
